    "disclaimer-type": "text",
    "disclaimer": "<p>*we guarantee a 30% reduction in bed-related falls with the combination of Stryker bods equipped with a bed exit system and falls-education training. lf a reduction of 30% in bed-related falls is not recognized after one full year (based on delivery date) of product use by the facility, we will pay you back a portion of the cost. Facility must meet eligibility requirements as outlined in the fall reduction contract.</p>\r\n<p>References:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>VHA Center for Engineering and Occupational Safety and Health, St. Louis, Missouri (July 2015). Bariatric Safe Patient Handling and Mobility Guidebook: A Resource Guide for Care of Person of Size. Retrieved from https://www.asphp.org/wp-content/uploads/2011/05/Baraiatrice-SPHM-guidebook-care-of-Person-of-Size.pdf</li>\r\n<li>Bariatric Safe Patient Handling and Mobility Guidebook: A Resource Guide for Care of Person of Size (Retrieved July 18, 2019) https://www.asphp.org/wp-content/uploads/2011/05/Baraiatrice-SPHM-guidebook-care-of-Person-of-Size.pdf</li>\r\n<li>Prevalence of Obesity Among Adults and Youth: United States, 2015–2016. NCHS Data Brief, Number 288, October 2017. https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/data/databriefs/db288.pdf&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Oct 28 2022 13:54:16 GMT+0000",
